entries[128052] = { ["name"] = "Felfume Slippers", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nFeet Cloth\n3 Armor\n+3 Intellect\n+5 Stamina\n+ 3 Critical Strike\n+ 4 Mastery\nDurability 80 / 80\nFelfume Raiment (0/6)\nFelfume Slippers\nFelfume Gloves\nFelfume Hood\nFelfume Pantaloons\nFelfume Robes\nFelfume Mantle\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Arcane: Intellect increased by 18 . (2) Set Fire: Intellect increased by 18 . (2) Set Frost: Intellect increased by 18 . (2) Set Shadow: Intellect increased by 18 . (2) Set Affliction: Intellect increased by 18 . (2) Set Demonology: Intellect increased by 18 . (2) Set Destruction: Intellect increased by 18 .\n(2) Set Discipline: Versatility increased by 22 . (2) Set Holy: Versatility increased by 22 .\n(4) Set Arcane: Your damaging spell casts have a 10% chance to cause a Fel Meteor to fall on your target. (Proc chance: 10%, 3s cooldown) (4) Set Fire: Your damaging spell casts have a 10% chance to cause a Fel Meteor to fall on your target. (Proc chance: 10%, 3s cooldown) (4) Set Frost: Your damaging spell casts have a 10% chance to cause a Fel Meteor to fall on your target. (Proc chance: 10%, 3s cooldown) (4) Set Shadow: Your damaging spell casts have a 10% chance to cause a Fel Meteor to fall on your target. (Proc chance: 10%, 3s cooldown) (4) Set Affliction: Your damaging spell casts have a 10% chance to cause a Fel Meteor to fall on your target. (Proc chance: 10%, 3s cooldown) (4) Set Demonology: Your damaging spell casts have a 10% chance to cause a Fel Meteor to fall on your target. (Proc chance: 10%, 3s cooldown) (4) Set Destruction: Your damaging spell casts have a 10% chance to cause a Fel Meteor to fall on your target. (Proc chance: 10%, 3s cooldown)\n(4) Set Discipline: Casting a healing spell has a 8% chance to cast a Ribbon of Light on an injured ally, healing up to 3 allies in its path. (Proc chance: 8%, 3s cooldown) (4) Set Holy: Casting a healing spell has a 8% chance to cast a Ribbon of Light on an injured all