entries[128289] = { ["name"] = "Scale of the Earth-Warder", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nOff Hand Shield\n25 Armor\n+1 Strength\n+3 Intellect\n+2 Stamina\n+ 1 Critical Strike\n+ 1 Mastery\n\nIron Artifact Relic Slot\nBlood Artifact Relic Slot\n\nClasses: Warrior\nEquip: Grants the Neltharion's Fury ability, which unleashes fire from your shield and greatly increases its defensive properties.\n\"...it was one of Neltharion's cast-off scales. It saved Magnar's life. The blast of flame parted around the black scale, but the sheer force carried Magnar out of the lair, sending him tumbling down the slopes of Highmountain.\"\nSell Price:" }
